{"type": "item.completed", "item": {"id": "item_10", "type": "command_execution", "command": "/bin/bash -c 'tail -3 cores/bench/experiments/log.jsonl'", "aggregated_output": "{\"id\": \"hyp-20261002-001-r13s0\", \"title\": \"Balance branch comparisons with parallel byte relation summaries\", \"category\": \"micro_opt\", \"motivation\": \"The champion scores 223.34 iterations/sec at median Fmax 95.961 MHz with 4,296,564 bracketed CoreMark cycles. An untouched placement-0 rebuild reproduces 88.343 MHz. Its five worst paths include a 16.574 ns, 37-cell path from registered rs2 bit zero through EX into the pending next-PC register, alongside the ALU and operand-capture paths. Local carry-prefix, duplicated shifter-bank and several shared right-shifter probes failed to improve the three-option median. Branch comparisons still use wide signed/unsigned relational operators; a balanced comparison can shorten their carry-dependent resolution without moving arithmetic onto the memory-return path.\", \"hypothesis\": {\"motivation\": \"The champion scores 223.34 iterations/sec at median Fmax 95.961 MHz with 4,296,564 bracketed CoreMark cycles. An untouched placement-0 rebuild reproduces 88.343 MHz. Its five worst paths include a 16.574 ns, 37-cell path from registered rs2 bit zero through EX into the pending next-PC register, alongside the ALU and operand-capture paths. Local carry-prefix, duplicated shifter-bank and several shared right-shifter probes failed to improve the three-option median. Branch comparisons still use wide signed/unsigned relational operators; a balanced comparison can shorten their carry-dependent resolution without moving arithmetic onto the memory-return path.\", \"hypothesis\": \"Replace only the EX branch relation datapath with four parallel eight-bit unsigned comparisons and a balanced two-level combination of equality/less-than summaries. This is a local branch-comparator micro_opt, preserving the pipeline, predictor, issue/retirement width and ever