{"type": "item.completed", "item": {"id": "item_5", "type": "command_execution", "command": "/bin/bash -c \"rg -n --hidden 'hyp-20261002-003-r13s2|219\\\\.09|41,346|41346|direction_fetch|85\\\\.308' cores/bench -g '\"'!LESSONS.md'\"'\"", "aggregated_output": "cores/bench/experiments/log.jsonl:37:{\"id\": \"hyp-20261002-003-r12s2\", \"title\": \"Banked hashed BTB with taken-only allocation preserves useful targets\", \"category\": \"predictor\", \"motivation\": \"The champion scores 223.34 with 4,296,564 timed CoreMark cycles at\\n95.961 MHz. Its 32-entry direct-mapped bimodal predictor produces 73,619\\naccepted control-transfer recoveries in the measured interval: 55,992\\nconditional branches, 15,638 direct jumps and 1,989 returns. Hot direct\\njumps repeatedly miss, showing target conflicts rather than a return-stack\\nopportunity. Every legal conditional branch currently allocates a row,\\neven on a not-taken miss that needs no target, evicting useful taken paths.\\nEarlier attempts mostly changed delivery or maintenance timing, and the\\nchampion already has registered fetch and training boundaries. Focus this\\nattempt solely on retaining useful predictor entries under conflicts.\\n\", \"hypothesis\": {\"motivation\": \"The champion scores 223.34 with 4,296,564 timed CoreMark cycles at\\n95.961 MHz. Its 32-entry direct-mapped bimodal predictor produces 73,619\\naccepted control-transfer recoveries in the measured interval: 55,992\\nconditional branches, 15,638 direct jumps and 1,989 returns. Hot direct\\njumps repeatedly miss, showing target conflicts rather than a return-stack\\nopportunity. Every legal conditional branch currently allocates a row,\\neven on a not-taken miss that needs no target, evicting useful taken paths.\\nEarlier attempts mostly changed delivery or maintenance timing, and the\\nchampion already has registered fetch and training boundaries. Focus this\\nattempt solely on retaining useful predictor entries under conflicts.\\n\", \"hypothesis\": \"Replace the 32-entry tagged bimodal BTB with one conflict-resistant\\n128-entry predictor: four indexed 32-entry banks, a reversible XOR index,\\nand taken-only allocation on a tag miss. Compute the seven-bit index as\\nPC[8:2] XOR PC[15:9], use index[6:5] as the bank and index[4:0] as its row,\\nand retain the entire PC[31:9] tag and 30 aligned t\n…[7398 of 10470 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:2eefc735b3b09a40]…\nation gates.\\n\"}], \"outcome\": \"regression\", \"fitness\": 204.88, \"delta_pct\": -8.27, \"vs_baseline\": 1590.43, \"fmax_mhz\": 85.308, \"ipc_coremark\": 2e-06, \"cycles\": 4163767, \"iterations\": 10, \"lut4\": 7350, \"ff\": 2719, \"seeds\": [88.379, 85.308, 85.308], \"perturbations\": [[0, 88.379, 11], [1, 85.308, 11], [2, 85.308, 11]], \"lutram\": 176, \"bsram\": 4, \"dsp\": 2, \"critical_path\": {\"from\": \"cpu/u_if/pc_10_s1\", \"to\": \"cpu/u_if/pc_9_s1\", \"slack_ns\": -6.315, \"arrival_ns\": 16.609, \"logic_cells\": 13, \"modules\": [\"clock_ibuf\", \"cpu/u_if\"]}, \"logic_levels\": 11, \"formal_passed\": true, \"cosim_passed\": true, \"error\": null, \"implementation_notes\": \"\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-02T13:23:08.477945Z\", \"slot\": 2, \"round_id\": 12, \"lesson\": \"- 2026-10-02 hyp-20261002-003-r12s2 (regression, -8.27%): Four indexed 32-row BTB banks with XOR hashing and taken-only allocation cut CoreMark cycles by 3.09%, but exposed a fetch-PC-to-next-PC critical path that lowered median Gowin Fmax from 95.961 to 85.308 MHz, outweighing the conflict reduction.\"}\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
