c implementation change,\\nwith no multicycle execution, pipeline changes, or operation caching.\\n\\nFor DIV and REM, form 32-bit unsigned magnitudes using conditional\\ntwo's-complement negation; DIVU and REMU use the original operands.\\nStarting with a 33-bit partial remainder R=0, consume dividend bits\\nfrom bit 31 down to bit 0 in 32 elaboration-time-unrolled steps. If \n…[4340 of 7412 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:4ae4b42da24e4801]…\nectness checks.\\n\"}], \"outcome\": \"regression\", \"fitness\": 14.25, \"delta_pct\": 17.57, \"vs_baseline\": 17.57, \"fmax_mhz\": 6.402, \"ipc_coremark\": 2e-06, \"cycles\": 4491485, \"iterations\": 10, \"lut4\": 4872, \"ff\": 460, \"seeds\": [6.086, 6.402, 6.402], \"perturbations\": [[0, 6.086, 190], [1, 6.402, 194], [2, 6.402, 194]], \"lutram\": 8, \"bsram\": 6, \"dsp\": 6, \"critical_path\": {\"from\": \"cpu/u_mem/reg_q.rd_3_s0\", \"to\": \"dmem_0_dmem_0_0_0_s\", \"slack_ns\": -159.323, \"arrival_ns\": 169.618, \"logic_cells\": 888, \"modules\": [\"clock_ibuf\", \"cpu/u_rf\", \"cpu/u_ex\", \"cpu/u_ex/u_alu\", \"cpu/u_ex\"]}, \"logic_levels\": 190, \"formal_passed\": true, \"cosim_passed\": true, \"error\": null, \"implementation_notes\": \"\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-02T02:29:06.010859Z\", \"slot\": 0, \"round_id\": 1, \"lesson\": \"- 2026-10-02 hyp-20261002-001-r1s0 (regression, +17.57%): Sharing DIV/REM reduced Gowin logic use by 60%, but 32 serial sign-dependent 33-bit additions retained a deep critical path, limiting median Fmax gains to about 18% with unchanged CoreMark cycles.\"}\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
