ttempt retained a deep\\ncombinational divider and gained only 17.57 percent over baseline; that\\narithmetic bottleneck has already been removed in the current champion.\\n\",\n    \"hypothesis\": \"Represent fetch/decode bubbles solely through the existing valid bit,\\nremoving late redirect and imem-stall signals from instruction payload\\nmasking and from the synchronous clear of ID/EX data. This is one local\\ncontrol-cone optimization, with the same pipeline\n…[6831 of 9903 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:18d2295d40226217]…\nmemory effects. Retain all existing assertions and gates.\\n\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"outcome\": \"regression\",\n  \"fitness\": 98.5,\n  \"delta_pct\": 0.01,\n  \"vs_baseline\": 712.71,\n  \"fmax_mhz\": 44.244,\n  \"ipc_coremark\": 2e-06,\n  \"cycles\": 4491817,\n  \"iterations\": 10,\n  \"lut4\": 2486,\n  \"ff\": 713,\n  \"seeds\": [\n    44.874,\n    44.244,\n    44.244\n  ],\n  \"perturbations\": [\n    [\n      0,\n      44.874,\n      15\n    ],\n    [\n      1,\n      44.244,\n      16\n    ],\n    [\n      2,\n      44.244,\n      16\n    ]\n  ],\n  \"lutram\": 8,\n  \"bsram\": 6,\n  \"dsp\": 6,\n  \"critical_path\": {\n    \"from\": \"cpu/u_rf/regs_regs_0_0_s0\",\n    \"to\": \"dmem_0_dmem_0_0_0_s\",\n    \"slack_ns\": -17.285,\n    \"arrival_ns\": 27.579,\n    \"logic_cells\": 15,\n    \"modules\": [\n      \"clock_ibuf\",\n      \"cpu/u_id\",\n      \"cpu/u_ex\",\n      \"cpu/u_ex/u_alu\",\n      \"cpu/u_ex\"\n    ]\n  },\n  \"logic_levels\": 15,\n  \"formal_passed\": true,\n  \"cosim_passed\": true,\n  \"error\": null,\n  \"implementation_notes\": \"\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-02T03:40:31.884302Z\",\n  \"slot\": 0,\n  \"round_id\": 2\n}\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
