 199.837 ns worst path spanning 156 cells through operand\\nforwarding, the ALU, and execute logic. There are no prior micro_opt\\nattempts or distilled lessons. The ALU contains separate signed and\\nunsigned division and remainder expressions; their deep combinational\\narithmetic is the strongest suspected timing bottleneck. Since every\\ninstruction shares this clock, a faster divider \n…[132955 of 136027 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:2521767ab5d451c4]…\nnd exactly-once\\nstores and retirement. Use a stable pending-request stimulus when\\nthe fetch address repeats; do not remove any intended branch outcome\\nor counter-saturation check. Run unchanged formal/cosim/CoreMark gates\\nand median Gowin timing on the combined champion implementation.\\n\"}], \"outcome\": \"regression\", \"fitness\": 135.43, \"delta_pct\": 2.83, \"vs_baseline\": 1017.41, \"fmax_mhz\": 54.896, \"ipc_coremark\": 2e-06, \"cycles\": 4053425, \"iterations\": 10, \"lut4\": 4307, \"ff\": 1399, \"seeds\": [54.994, 54.896, 54.896], \"perturbations\": [[0, 54.994, 17], [1, 54.896, 16], [2, 54.896, 16]], \"lutram\": 52, \"bsram\": 6, \"dsp\": 2, \"critical_path\": {\"from\": \"cpu/u_ex/reg_q.rd_3_s0\", \"to\": \"cpu/u_if/dequeue_pc_q_1_s1\", \"slack_ns\": -13.184, \"arrival_ns\": 23.478, \"logic_cells\": 43, \"modules\": [\"clock_ibuf\", \"cpu/u_fwd\", \"cpu/u_ex\", \"cpu/u_if\"]}, \"logic_levels\": 17, \"formal_passed\": true, \"cosim_passed\": true, \"error\": null, \"implementation_notes\": \"\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-02T05:24:38.118066Z\", \"slot\": 2, \"round_id\": 4}\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
