{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_54","type":"agent_message","text":"Recovery prequalification passes the unit suite, but its placement result is below the champion and exposes the general ALU-to-memory path. I’m testing a dedicated registered load/store address path next. This showed gains earlier in the history, and it can now bypass the ALU result mux and blocking-completion mux without adding cycles."}}
