{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_61","type":"agent_message","text":"The raw-return probe’s clock gain did not repay its extra load stalls. The final probe targets provenance capture: incoming decode records are captured only when EX advances, so their tag matches can use stable instruction owners without the late hold/advance muxes. This keeps instruction latency unchanged."}}
