 can retain their old\nvalues but never create a request or forwarding owner. Select accepted\nnonload WB data from registered banks after this boundary, retaining\nexact load extraction and current accepted-load latency.\n\nTo avoid the 37-cell branch-successor path exposed by r13s1, capture\nbranch outcome, target legality and recovery as narrow decisions\nseparately from the target and PC+4 words at that same edge. Select the\nsuccessor from these registered decisions in MEM; accepted-MEM redirect\nand training timing remain unchanged. Preserve the resolving instruction\non recovery, kill younger lane owners, and qualify pending completion by\nits valid captured owner. Do not retain generic payload masks or packet\nmerges ahead of lane data flops. This is a single stable-owner execution\npipeline topology: early matching, continuously owned bypass sources and\nindependent registered results share one in-order instruction identity.\nDo not add raw-return stages, RF snapshots, synchronous RF RAMs,\narithmetic before complete operands or extra result-dependency bubbles.''')\nd['hypothesis']=d['hypothesis'].replace('RF reads and the unchanged\\\\nALU-to-memory path can limit it.','RF reads, post-register result selection and scalar arithmetic can\\\\nlimit it.')\nd['changes'][0]['description'] += '''Wire the shared class/metadata owner and dedicated registered LSU\npacket to MEM while retaining existing stage and retirement timing.\n'''\nd['changes'][1]['description'] += '''Bank scalar, link, completed and request results at the existing\nEX/MEM edge. Register a dedicated native-ADD LSU address/request and\nindependent branch decisions/target/PC+4 words. Keep late general\nresult muxes and payload merges off these bank inputs; hold or cancel\nowners with actual stage-update priority.\n'''\nd['changes'].extend([\n {'file':'rtl/core_pkg.sv','description':'Define shared instruction ownership/class and independent registered execution/result/request bundles. Retain full PCs, addresses and original captured RVFI metadata.'},\n {'file':'rtl/mem_stage.sv','description':'Drive dmem from the owned registered request bank and select accepted nonload data from registered result lanes. Use the owned effective address for load extraction and RVFI, preserving trap qualification, accepted load forwarding and hold behavior.'}\n])\np.write_text(yaml.safe_dump(d,sort_keys=False,width=78))\njsonschema.validate(d,json.loads(Path('schemas/hypothesis.schema.json').read_text()))\nprint('Final combined stable-owner lane hypothesis is schema valid')\nPY\"", "aggregated_output": "", "exit_code": null, "status": "in_progress"}}
