"cycles\": 4491817,\n  \"critical_path\": {\n    \"from\": \"cpu/u_rf/regs_regs_0_0_s0\",\n    \"to\": \"cpu/u_id/id_ex_w.rs2_val_0_s100\",\n    \"slack_ns\": -19.082,\n    \"arrival_ns\": 29.376,\n    \"logic_cells\": 52,\n    \"modules\": [\n      \"clock_ibuf\",\n      \"cpu/u_id\",\n      \"cpu/u_ex\",\n      \"cpu/u_if\",\n      \"cpu/u_hazard\",\n      \"cpu/u_id\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\nPROPOSAL: Replace only DIV, DIVU, REM, and REMU with one shared, bounded multicycle\nradix-2 restoring divider, leaving RV32I operations and multiplication on\ntheir existing fast path. Register the fully forwarded operands and the\noperation once when a valid divide instruction can start. Use registered\nmagnitude preparation, a 33-bit trial subtraction and one quotient-bit\nupdate per iteration for exactly 32 iterations, and registered sign\ncorrection. Use the trial subtraction's\n…[32046 of 35118 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:fbd6b5d382cb7bfc]…\nhyp-20261002-002-r7s1\",\n  \"title\": \"Isolate execute between registered operands and registered recovery\",\n  \"category\": \"structural\",\n  \"outcome\": \"improvement\",\n  \"fitness\": 187.23,\n  \"fmax_mhz\": 83.934,\n  \"cycles\": 4483027,\n  \"critical_path\": {\n    \"from\": \"cpu/u_id/reg_q.alu_b_val_0_s0\",\n    \"to\": \"dmem_3_dmem_3_0_0_s\",\n    \"slack_ns\": -8.569,\n    \"arrival_ns\": 18.864,\n    \"logic_cells\": 10,\n    \"modules\": [\n      \"clock_ibuf\",\n      \"cpu/u_ex/u_alu\",\n      \"cpu/u_ex\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n{\n  \"id\": \"hyp-20261002-003-r7s2\",\n  \"title\": \"Parallel BTB banks with local hysteresis and prequalified recovery\",\n  \"category\": \"predictor\",\n  \"outcome\": \"regression\",\n  \"fitness\": 145.71,\n  \"fmax_mhz\": 64.252,\n  \"cycles\": 4409538,\n  \"critical_path\": {\n    \"from\": \"cpu/u_if/pc_13_s1\",\n    \"to\": \"cpu/u_id/reg_q.prediction_wrong_taken_s0\",\n    \"slack_ns\": -11.001,\n    \"arrival_ns\": 21.296,\n    \"logic_cells\": 30,\n    \"modules\"