{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_17","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -c \"python3 -B - <<'PY'\nimport sys,json,time\nsys.path.insert(0,'test/cosim')\nfrom reference import RV32IM\ncpu=RV32IM()\ncpu.load_elf('/srv/hwebench/clones/gpt-6_1-sol_xhigh-v2-rep5/bench/programs/coremark.elf')\ntables={n:[None]*n for n in (16,32,64,128)}\nstats={n:{'mispredictions':0,'controls':0,'hits':0} for n in tables}\nactive=False\nnret=0\nbase_bubbles=0\nconditional=0\njumps=0\nstart=time.monotonic()\nfor i in range(7000000):\n r=cpu.step()\n pc=r['pc']; npc=r['npc']; insn=r['insn']; op=insn&127\n control=op in (0x63,0x67,0x6f) and not r['trap']\n if active:\n  nret+=1\n  base_bubbles+=int(control and (op\"'!=0x63 or npc!=(pc+4)&0xffffffff))\n  conditional+=int(op==0x63)\n  jumps+=int(op in (0x67,0x6f))\n for n,table in tables.items():\n  idx=(pc>>2)&(n-1)\n  entry=table[idx]\n  hit=entry is not None and entry[0]==pc\n  pred=entry[1] if hit and entry[2]>=2 else (pc+4)&0xffffffff\n  if active:\n   stats[n]['\"'mispredictions']+=int(pred\"'!=npc)\n   stats[n]['\"'controls']+=int(control)\n   stats[n]['hits']+=int(control and hit)\n  if control:\n   taken=npc\"'!=((pc+4)&0xffffffff)\n   if op==0x63:\n    imm=cpu.sx(((insn>>31)<<12)|(((insn>>7)&1)<<11)|(((insn>>25)&0x3f)<<5)|(((insn>>8)&15)<<1),13)\n    target=(pc+imm)&0xffffffff\n    counter=max(0,min(3,entry[2]+(1 if taken else -1))) if hit else (2 if taken else 1)\n   else:\n    target=npc\n    counter=3\n   if not target&3: table[idx]=(pc,target,counter)\n   elif hit: table[idx]=None\n  elif hit:\n   table[idx]=None\n if r['\"'mem_wmask'] and r['mem_addr']==0x10000100:\n  active=True\n if r['mem_wmask'] and r['mem_addr']==0x10000104:\n  break\nelse: raise RuntimeError('No stop marker')\ncycles=4491485\nfor n,s in stats.items():\n saved=base_bubbles-s['mispredictions']\n s['saved_bubbles']=saved\n s['ideal_fitness_gain_pct']=round(100*(cycles/(cycles-saved)-1),3)\nprint(json.dumps({'retirements_between_markers':