mbinational M-extension ALU, so a\\nmodest fetch predictor can improve iterations per cycle without extending\\nthat dominant arithmetic path. Its timing and area costs must still be\\nmeasured rather than assuming that better prediction guarantees better fitness.\\nA retirement-trace model of the existing canonical CoreMark ELF co\n…[101251 of 104323 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:53caf282e20282bb]…\necute holds, nonempty recovery, reset, stale predictions and frontier turnaround. Cover exact dynamic frontier marking with repeated PCs, and require correct RVFI/order and exactly-once stores. Adapt mutation triggers to accepted snapshots and explicitly check the declared refill timing.\"}], \"outcome\": \"regression\", \"fitness\": 195.67, \"delta_pct\": 4.51, \"vs_baseline\": 1514.44, \"fmax_mhz\": 85.838, \"ipc_coremark\": 2e-06, \"cycles\": 4386794, \"iterations\": 10, \"lut4\": 6124, \"ff\": 2446, \"seeds\": [73.896, 85.838, 85.838], \"perturbations\": [[0, 73.896, 11], [1, 85.838, 10], [2, 85.838, 10]], \"lutram\": 44, \"bsram\": 4, \"dsp\": 2, \"critical_path\": {\"from\": \"cpu/u_id/reg_q.valid_s0\", \"to\": \"cpu/u_id/reg_q.alu_b_val_11_s0\", \"slack_ns\": -8.533, \"arrival_ns\": 18.831, \"logic_cells\": 14, \"modules\": [\"clock_ibuf\", \"cpu/u_ex\", \"cpu/u_fwd\", \"cpu/u_id\"]}, \"logic_levels\": 11, \"formal_passed\": true, \"cosim_passed\": true, \"error\": null, \"implementation_notes\": \"\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-02T09:16:31.223047Z\", \"slot\": 2, \"round_id\": 8}\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
